    "quota": {
        "window_seconds": 86400,
        "budget_points": 12000,
        "read_cost": 1,
        "write_cost": 1,
        "_note": "Developer token Basic tier = 15,000 operations/day SHARED across the whole platform (dossier section 4.2). Budget kept under the cap (12,000/day) so the breaker trips before Google does. Dynamic per-CID token bucket handled by RateLimitError(retry_after) from QuotaErrorDetails.retry_delay."
    },
